======================================================================
PART 8. NOT FIXED: FOR THE OWNER TO DECIDE
======================================================================
These change how the shop works, so they were not changed without asking.

A. Stock can be held by fake guest orders (medium)
   Physical products can be ordered as a guest (cash on delivery). The limit is 5 orders
   per email per hour, but a script can use a new email for each order and hold all the
   IEM stock in PENDING orders until the admin cancels them by hand.
   Options: limit per phone number too, require an account for physical orders as well,
   or cancel unconfirmed guest orders automatically after some hours.

B. "Payment sent" pressed twice at the same moment (low)
   Two simultaneous clicks can both pass the checks: the admin gets two chat messages
   and two emails. Nothing is lost or paid twice. Could use the same compare-and-swap
   as fix #3 if wanted.

C. Hidden products can still be looked up by id in the cart (low)
   getCartLinesAction returns the name and price of a product that was switched off,
   if someone knows its id (a random UUID, so hard to guess). It is shown as unavailable
   and can't be ordered.

D. STAFF role
   STAFF exists in the database but has no rights anywhere (tested: every admin action
   refuses it). Fine as long as nobody expects staff accounts to work.

